The '''Mildenhall Horse Farm''' is a stable located to the southwest of [[Ambershire]] in [[Northwind]]. Ran by the Geringt family, they have served the Mildenhalls for many generations.<ref>[[Horsekeeper Geringt#Quotes]]</ref> Along with the [[Crawford Winery]], it is a part of the agricultural aspects of Northwind that are overseen by [[Lady Josephine Mildenhall]]. They take care of all the contestants' steeds for the [[Jousting Grounds|Northwind Joust]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|30|To Look A Gift Horse In The Mouth}}</ref>

Players can purchase their riding skills and both the normal and epic [[human]] [[mount]]s here.

